In `Rota.decideSwap`, after an approval succeeds, every other still-pending request for the same shift is now set to refused with the same `decidedAt`. All the checks that can throw run before anything is changed, so a failed approval alters no request. Refusals, other shifts' requests and already-decided requests are untouched.

I couldn't see the rest of the file, so I assumed `this.swaps` holds every request and matched the `SEARCH` text using the 4-space/8-space indentation shown in your excerpt.
